    <string name="food_safety_guidelines_body">• Only share food that is fit for human consumption and within its safe-to-eat window.\n\n• Keep perishable food chilled (at or below 5°C) or hot (at or above 60°C) until pickup.\n\n• Declare all allergens. If in doubt, list it.\n\n• Never share food that is spoiled, past its use-by date, or has been left at room temperature for long periods.\n\n• Collectors: inspect food at pickup, transport it promptly, and refrigerate perishables as soon as possible.\n\nShareBite connects people but does not inspect or certify food. Follow your local food safety regulations.</string>
